        "stashed": false,
        "effect": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Upon the behemoth&rsquo;s death the players can find several items and caps among its body. Roll 3d20 for the number of caps that can be found, and 4 CD</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"color: #fde635;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">for the number of junk items found. The body may also contain up to two weapons, and 2d20 rounds of ammunition appropriate to the weapons found, at the GM's discretion.</span></p>"
